1
00:00:00,034 --> 00:00:02,164
(Past Sheldon:)Come, I'll show you
the rest of the apartment.

2
00:00:02,328 --> 00:00:04,578
(Past Leonard:)Good. I passed the barriers.

3
00:00:04,747 --> 00:00:06,957
(Past Sheldon:)The second barrier. Don't get cocky.

4
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:11,880
(Past Sheldon:)This is the bathroom.

5
00:00:12,463 --> 00:00:13,963
(Past Sheldon:)Are you fairly regular?

6
00:00:17,593 --> 00:00:20,883
(Past Leonard:)-Uh-- I guess.
-This isn't going to work if you're guessing.

7
00:00:22,056 --> 00:00:24,476
(Past Sheldon:)When do you evacuate your bowels?

8
00:00:25,601 --> 00:00:27,061
(Past Leonard:)When I have to.

9
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:30,270
(Past Sheldon:)When you have to?
I'm sorry, I don't rent to hippies.

10
00:00:34,568 --> 00:00:37,318
I'm sorry, in the morning. Around 8.

11
00:00:37,905 --> 00:00:40,945
I can't give you 8. I can give you 7:30.

12
00:00:41,826 --> 00:00:43,156
(Past Leonard:)Fine, I'll take it.

13
00:00:43,327 --> 00:00:44,997
(Past Sheldon:)Third barrier passed.

14
00:00:46,163 --> 00:00:48,333
(Past Sheldon:)You have won the right to see your room.

15
00:00:48,499 --> 00:00:49,829
Pizah.

16
00:00:53,712 --> 00:00:55,752
(Past Leonard:)-Is this it?
-No, this is my room.

17
00:00:55,923 --> 00:00:57,673
(Past Sheldon:)People don't go in my room.

18
00:00:58,384 --> 00:01:01,024
So where do you sleep? Heh.

